      "name": "LACK OF SUBTLETY",
      "username": "LACK_OF_SUBTLETY",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/bcef8e/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-13T05:11:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I just had a question pop up, making me wonder about if I've been playing this card properly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Does playing the Mask cause it's effect to go off?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I've always said no, because playing a card preceeds the effect and therefore the playing of the card is finished before the text comes into play, so no additional cards get played. But one of my players disagreed tonight.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>My search-fu was weak, does anyone have a good answer?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:46.754Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
